    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d909">

                <pb facs="0868" n="784" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg784"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72116/557</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 17, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1926. Your 3275, May 7, 4 p.m. You may present note to President of International
                    Red Cross suggested by French Ambassador as outlined in your 3072, April 13, 3
                    p.m., regarding use of asphyxiating and poisonous gases in warfare.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
